WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.267
Grandpa Bill: We'll be back soon.

2
00:00:06.268 --> 00:00:09.067
Mom: Enjoy your walk!

3
00:00:09.068 --> 00:00:11.605
Sam: They finally left!

4
00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:15.672
Grandma Ruby: Now we can get ready for the party!

5
00:00:15.673 --> 00:00:18.411
Mom: Dad went to get balloons.

6
00:00:18.412 --> 00:00:21.466
Can you hang up streamers? Sam:

7
00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:26.082
Sure. I'll make posters too! Dad:

8
00:00:26.083 --> 00:00:30.042
Grandpa called. He's on his way back with Lilly. Mom:

9
00:00:30.043 --> 00:00:34.091
Time to hide, everybody! Sam:

10
00:00:34.092 --> 00:00:39.960
Come on, Lucky. Let's hide here! Grandma

11
00:00:39.961 --> 00:00:42.605
Ruby: I see them coming! Tia:

12
00:00:42.606 --> 00:00:46.207
Shh! He'll hear us!

13
00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:48.951
Grandpa Bill: We're home!

14
00:00:48.952 --> 00:00:52.465
Sam: Not yet, Lucky. No, Lucky! Stay!

15
00:00:52.466 --> 00:00:55.283
Lucky: Woof! Woof!

16
00:00:55.284 --> 00:00:59.137
Sam: Oh Lucky!

17
00:00:59.138 --> 00:01:01.737
Grandpa Bill: What's all this?

18
00:01:01.738 --> 00:01:06.047
Everyone: Surprise!

19
00:01:06.048 --> 00:01:14.615
Grandpa Bill: Wow! Thank you!

20
00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:18.480
Lilly: Ga-pa . . . Ga-pa . . .

21
00:01:18.481 --> 00:01:20.338
Sam: What, Lilly?

22
00:01:20.339 --> 00:01:24.410
Lilly: Ga-pa! Ga-pa!

23
00:01:24.411 --> 00:01:29.010
Sam: "Grandpa!" That's what she's trying to say!

24
00:01:29.011 --> 00:01:31.733
Mom: Her first word!

25
00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:39.658
Grandpa Bill: And it's "Grandpa!" What a birthday party!

